        "text": {
            "description_html": "<P><b>Baldwin Cody Multi-Point Trim with Beavertail Lever </b></P>\r\n\r\n<P><B>Features and Specifications</B> for Baldwin Cody Multi- Point Trim with Beavertail Lever: <UL>\r\n<li>Estate Collection finish options to suit any home</li>\r\n<li>Profile or American Cylinder</li>\r\n<li>Available as complete sets or minus lever sets</li>\r\n<li>Easy installation with one box shipping for 1 3/4\" door</li>\r\n<li>Through-bolt mounting</li>\r\n<li>Fits 92 and 105mm Cylinder to Lever C2C</li>\r\n<li>Thick door kits available</li>\r\n</ul></p>\r\n\r\n<P><B>Dimensions</B> for  Baldwin Cody Multi-Point Trim with Beavertail Lever<ul>\r\n<li>Escutcheon plate height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Escutcheon plate width: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection of handle: 2.9\"</li>\r\n</ul></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<P><B>Available In</B><UL>\r\n<li>Keyed Entry: Key outside - Turn knob inside</li>\r\n<li>Passage: Active, no cylinder or turnknob</li>\r\n<li>Inactive outside, Active inside: Non-keyed</li>\r\n<li>Dummy:  Inactive, use as trim only</li>\r\n<li>Patio:  Non-keyed, turnbolt inside</li>\r\n</UL></P>\r\n<P><B>Configurations</B> for  Baldwin Cody Multi-Point Trim with Beavertail Lever<ul>\r\n<li>#1 - Profile Cylinder Below Handle:  92mm CTC, 8.5\" Mounting Hole CTC</li>\r\n<li>#2 - American Cylinder Above Handle:  105mm CTC, 8.5\" Mounting Hole CTC</li>\r\n<li>#3 - American Cylinder Below Handle:  92mm CTC, 8.375\" Mounting Hole CTC</li>\r\n<li>#4 - Profile Cylinder Below Handle:  92mm CTC, 7.875\" Mounting Hole CTC</li>\r\n<li>#5 - American Cylinder Above or Below Handle:  92mm CTC, 7.5625\" Mounting Hole CTC</li>\r\n<li>#6 - American Cylinder Above Handle:  92mm CTC, 7.25\" Mounting Hole CTC</li>\r\n</ul></p>\r\n\r\n<p><B>The Lever is Non-handed</B></p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>NOTE: When you choose a finish, it applies to both the interior and exterior hardware.</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<br>",
